 "answer": "[ESCALATED-PRIORITY]\nCD-10407: Customer inquiry regarding duplicate charges\n\nDear Customer,\n\nThank you for reaching out. We understand your concern about the duplicate charges. As per our policy, any duplicate charges are fully refunded, irrespective of their age. Since this charge was made less than 30 days ago, it qualifies for a full refund of $89.00.\n\nWe have already initiated the refund process through Billing and expect it to reach your original payment method within the specified timeframe. No further action is required from your end.\n\nPlease note that we cannot guarantee immediate receipt due to system processing times. Thank you for understanding.\n\nBest regards,\nCloudDesk Support Team",
